  "notes": "{深|ふか}まる is an intransitive godan verb meaning something becomes deeper or more profound on its own.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive): {深|ふか}まる - something deepens\n- ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive): ⟦{深|ふか}める→深める：02407_fukameru⟧ - to deepen something\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{深|ふか}まって⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates a state of being deepened or intensified.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- ⟦{秋|あき}→秋：02276_aki⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{深|ふか}まる: autumn advances/deepens\n- ⟦{夜|よる}→夜：00487_yoru⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{深|ふか}まる: night grows late\n- ⟦{理解|りかい}→理解：03674_rikai⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{深|ふか}まる: understanding deepens\n- ⟦{友情|ゆうじょう}→友情：03648_yuujou⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{深|ふか}まる: friendship deepens\n- ⟦{疑惑|ぎわく}→疑惑：13602_giwaku⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{深|ふか}まる: suspicion deepens\n\nOften used for abstract concepts (relationships, emotions, seasons) rather than physical depth.",
